# Normalize line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, Git stores whatever the working tree has (CRLF on Windows)
# and every checkout on another platform shows a whole-file diff. Keeping
# text normalized to LF in the object store fixes that without changing
# what Windows tools see, since .ps1 and .java are checked out as CRLF.
* text=auto

*.java   text
*.ps1    text
*.md     text
*.json   text
*.ini    text

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png    binary
*.jar    binary
*.plugin binary
